# ─── Build context ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All three Dockerfiles (api, ingestion, web) use context: . (repo root) and
# share this file. Do NOT exclude any app or package source directories here —
# each Dockerfile only COPYs what it needs, so unused files are harmless.

# ─── Version control / tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.turbo
.agents
.npmrc
.prettierignore
.prettierrc
*.md
skills-lock.json

# ─── Wolf / Claude config ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.wolf
.claude

# ─── Dev artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log

# ─── Env files (secrets must never enter the build context) ───────────────────
.env
.env.*
